label ch4sc6:

    window hide dissolve
    play music forest_1 fadein 1.0
    scene black with Dissolve (1.0)
    scene ch4sc6 with dissolve
    $ renpy.pause()
    scene ch4sc06_001 with Dissolve(2.0)
    mc "Hey Dalen. All good here?"
    scene ch4sc06_002 with dissolve
    da "[mc]... your timing couldn’t be better."
    da "I was just looking over these maps, and I’ve planned a route for you."
    scene ch4sc06_003 with dissolve
    da "It only takes you as far as Isla de Inmortui, though."
    da "I can’t guide you further, as I’ve never been there myself."
    da "But you should probably keep an eye out for some sort of cave."
    da "The chalice won’t just be out in the open for anyone to take."
    scene ch4sc06_004 with dissolve
    mc "I understand. I'll figure things out when I reach the island. How will I get there, though?"
    mc "You said you were arranging transport for me. Do you have your own ship?"
    scene ch4sc06_003 with dissolve
    da "I’m afraid not."
    da "However, there's a crew currently docked at the port that owes me a favor."
    da "I've sailed with their father in the past, they can be trusted... at least as much as you can trust pirates."
    scene ch4sc06_005 with dissolve
    da "They've agreed to take you to Inmortui and drop you off."
    da "It’s the best I could do on such short notice."
    scene ch4sc06_006 with dissolve
    mc "It will have to do."
    mc "Given the island's reputation, I can’t imagine many sailors would be jumping at the chance to go near it."
    scene ch4sc06_005 with dissolve
    da "Exactly. Hopefully the divines smile upon you when you arrive."
    da "That is all I have for you. You should head to the port and meet the crew."
    scene ch4sc06_006 with dissolve
    mc "I will. I just have to say my goodbyes."
    mc "Speaking of... Eliza... could you?"
    scene ch4sc06_005 with dissolve
    da "Sylph and I will visit her every day."
    da "It’s the least we can do for a guild member and... for Oren’s daughter."
    da "Once she is up for it, I'll have Sylph give her some assignments here at the guild."
    da "Like helping with organizing contracts and payments."
    scene ch4sc06_006 with dissolve
    mc "Thank you, Dalen. I appreciate it. And I know Oren would too."
    scene ch4sc06_007 with dissolve
    mc "I’ll be back before you know it."
    stop music fadeout 1.5
    scene black with Dissolve(2)
    jump ch4sc7
